'''Shakurel Lion''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]] and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shakurel Lion
|image = E 473.png
|appearance = [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Arena of Honor/Attack of the Shakurels|Attack of the Shakurels]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
Shakurel Lion has low health and attack power, along with low range and a somewhat slow attack rate. Ability-wise, he [[Strengthen|strengthens]] by 100% when he is below 50% HP.

==Strategy==
This enemy isn't threatening. Any [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] will make short work of him, as well as strong [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]]. Do not worry about his strengthen, since his base attack power is low enough that it barely makes a difference.

